---
source: crates/oxc_formatter_css/tests/fixtures/mod.rs
---
==================== Input ====================
/* A selector with more than 2 simple selectors + combinators (counted FLAT,
   `.x.y:not(...)` = 3) indents its continuation lines: a broken pseudo arg
   lands at +4 and its `)` at +2 (oxc-project/oxc#24843). */

/* 3 flat (pseudo x3), no combinator: outer indent applies */
:where(.aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa):where(.bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb):where(.cc) {
  color: red;
}

/* 2 flat: no outer indent, arg at +2 and `)` at 0 */
.x:not(.bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb) {
  color: red;
}

/* 3 flat within ONE compound: outer indent applies */
.x.y:not(.bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb) {
  color: red;
}

/* Combinator case: breaks at the combinator, compound stays flat */
.parent .x.y:not(.bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb) {
  color: red;
}

